/*
  LiveMotorStatus.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0170 · LiveMotorStatus (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `LiveMotorStatus`
  resolves (table "LiveMotorStatus") lives here with its web English value. These entries fold
  into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the
  shared catalog.

  The first group holds the keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/driving/components/driving-dynamics/LiveMotorStatus.tsx) — the `dynamics.*` gauge
  labels, the shift-state copy, and the empty message. The remaining keys back the native-only
  chrome (freshness chip, loading + error + retry copy).
*/

